WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
Here’s the trick for lazy vowels.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.480
In abolition, you can barely hear the o.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.180
So find a relative of the word where that part gets the stress.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.400
Abolish.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.680
Now the o is loud and clear.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.310
Say the relative, and the spelling shows itself.
